The '''Light-Reducing Spell''' is a vision [[Spells|spell]] that blocks out the brightest lights to protect one's eyesight.

==Description==
Has a diamond sigil in the center with a few markings inside of it, and has an overlapping circle drawn over each corner. A larger diamond encases it with convergence signs drawn at each corner, and a line drawn into the inner circles. There are additional branched lines drawn between each circle that extend to the outer diamond, with two lines forming a V-shape outside of it.{{Ref|m|36|30}}

==Usage==
When used on glasses, the spell will block out the harshest lighting. It is used to protect one's eyesight when their vision is going.


